@startuml quantum
!theme plain
title Class Diagram - Quantum Bridge (Qiskit / Cirq)

class QuantumBridge {
  - _qiskit: QuantumCircuit | None
  - _cirq: module | None
  - _aer: AerSimulator | None
  + load(): None
  - _parse_circuit(qasm_text)
  + validate_qasm(qasm_text) -> dict
  + simulate_qasm(qasm_text, shots) -> dict
  + evaluate_vqe_program(qubits, layers) -> dict
}

class validate_circuit_text {
  {static} validate_circuit_text(text) -> dict
}

QuantumBridge ..> validate_circuit_text : used by
note right of QuantumBridge
  Compatible with Qiskit 1.x and 2.x.
  Simulation requires optional qiskit-aer;
  VQE evaluation uses Cirq Simulator.
end note

@enduml